# Copy this file to .env.local (it is gitignored) and fill it in. Vite only reads VITE_ variables.
#
# "Sign in with Google": the OAuth Client ID from Google Cloud Console (a "Web application" client).
# It is NOT a secret: it ends up in the browser. Use the SAME value as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID on the server.
# Leave empty and the Google button simply does not show.
# On Vercel this must be set BEFORE the build (Vite bakes it into the code), so redeploy after changing it.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
